313
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,630
They could be true.

314
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,630
But they're not.

315
00:15:25,420 --> 00:15:27,210
Yeah. It's a fine line, huh?

316
00:15:28,130 --> 00:15:31,010
Why are you lying to him?

317
00:15:28,130 --> 00:15:31,010
I don't know.

318
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:36,010
He said he did this stuff, I said I did it too. He got so excited, it was fun.

319
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:37,310
Honey?

320
00:15:37,470 --> 00:15:42,350
It's a disgusting habit, and I want you to quit now!

321
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:45,190
She's helped so many people quit smoking.

322
00:15:46,020 --> 00:15:47,690
We'd better get going.

323
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:50,820
You have a church group meeting.

324
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:50,820
Right.

325
00:15:54,070 --> 00:15:58,080
Well, it was nice meeting you.

326
00:15:54,070 --> 00:15:58,080
You too.

327
00:15:58,950 --> 00:16:02,960
And, Ursula, it was really nice meeting you tonight!

328
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:06,130
Pheebs, come on! Bunny versus Doodie. We're waiting!

329
00:16:06,250 --> 00:16:07,160
Let's go.

330
