Okay, guys. One match, winner take all.

331
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:16,260
Wait. What does the winner get?

332
00:16:16,430 --> 00:16:18,300
Pride.

333
00:16:16,430 --> 00:16:18,300
And dignity.

334
00:16:18,470 --> 00:16:21,180
Heh. Okay, if you say so.

335
00:16:21,350 --> 00:16:23,390
All right, ready, set, go!

336
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:26,730
Come on!

337
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:26,730
Come on!

338
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:38,830
Wow, they're both really strong.

339
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:38,830
Or equally weak.

340
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:42,830
Oh, God. Chandler's making his sex face.

341
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:53,720
So you getting tired?

342
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:53,720
No. I could do this all day.

343
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:56,260
Yeah. Me too.

344
00:16:58,430 --> 00:17:01,560
Getting a little tired, though.

345
00:16:58,430 --> 00:17:01,560
God, I'm exhausted.

346
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:07,850
This is starting to look bad for me, okay? Mona's standing right there.

347
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:13,110
Oh, God, she's talking to Joey! You've got to let me win!

348
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:16,070
No way. Let me win. My wife thinks I'm a wimp.

349
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,820
Hey, at least you have a wife.

350
00:17:17,990 --> 00:17:21,620
I keep getting divorces and knocking people up.

351
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:26,290
And I'm dressed as doodie.

352
00:17:27,210 --> 00:17:32,300
You're Spud-nik.

353
00:17:27,210 --> 00:17:32,300
Come on, who we kidding? I'm doodie.

354
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:36,090
Please? She's watching.

355
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:36,090
Ugh.

356
00:17:36,970 --> 00:17:39,470
Fine.

357
00:17:36,970 --> 00:17:39,470
Thanks.

358
00:17:40,850 --> 00:17:43,060
Oh, no.

359
00:17:40,850 --> 00:17:43,060
Oh, yeah!

360
00:17:43,220 --> 00:17:44,810
Yay!

361
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:46,730
My hero!

362
00:17:46,890 --> 00:17:48,230
You're a weird lady.

363
