423
00:21:14,890 --> 00:21:18,150
Oh, yeah, uh, Chandler let me win.

424
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:24,150
No, Chandler's really strong. Oh, my arm is so sore. Oh, nurse?

425
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:29,120
I am strong. I'll show you.

426
00:21:29,280 --> 00:21:30,910
Chandler, please.

427
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:32,990
Oh, what's the matter? Are you scared?

428
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,580
Let's go, big bunny!

429
00:21:37,170 --> 00:21:39,330
One, two, three. Go!

430
00:21:45,380 --> 00:21:47,090
I'm gonna kill myself.

